; A KEPT FILE FOLLOWS THE ASSIGN TOO.  One written before the drawer named
; its drivers through AmiNetXDuo: says DEVICE=SYS:AmiNetXDuo/Devs/Networks/...
; and would go on opening that drawer's drivers under a library from wherever
; the assign points next.  The Installer cannot read the line, so
; InstallSameFile rewrites it: only a DEVICE line naming one of our drivers
; in this drawer, or the one the assign still names, and only its value.
