                        S_SAMEFILE KEPT_IF (tackon D_DEVS "Networks")
                        "AmiNetXDuo:Devs/Networks")
                       (prompt "Pointing the kept configuration at this "
                               "drawer's drivers")
                       (help "A kept interface file that names a driver "
                             "of this drawer by its full path is changed to "
                             "name it through AmiNetXDuo:.  Nothing else in "
                             "the file changes.")))
              (message
                "\"" KEPT_IF "\" could not be updated.  If its DEVICE line "
                "names a driver by this drawer's full path, change it to "
                "AmiNetXDuo:Devs/Networks/ followed by the driver's name."))))))

